Package: bauhaus
Title: 'ggplot2' Themes from the Bauhaus Clock Screensaver Dials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ashwin", "Malshe", , "ashwinpapers@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("The Zalando Sans Project Authors", role = "cph",
           comment = "Zalando Sans Expanded font, SIL Open Font License 1.1")
  )
Description: Sixteen 'ggplot2' themes, one for each day dial of the Bauhaus
    Clock screensaver. Each theme paints the plot on the dial's paper plate,
    complete with the screensaver's fine paper grain, sets type in the
    screensaver's typeface (Zalando Sans Expanded, bundled), and takes its
    text, grid, geom and palette colours from the dial's measured inks,
    steel, lume and shadow tints. Matching discrete, continuous and binned
    colour scales are included.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://ashgreat.github.io/bauhaus-clock-ggplot/,
